<report>
<line><title>Sample size for paired cohort study</title></line>
<line></line>
<line>Event rate in control group = <in>pc</in></line>
<line>Event rate in experimental group = <in>ps</in></line>
<line>Correlation for failure between experimental and control subjects = <in>r</in></line>
<line>Alpha = <in>alpha</in></line>
<line>Power = <in>power</in></line>
<line></line>
<line>Estimated minimum sample size = <in>size</in> pairs<block name="assumptions"></line>
<line></line>
<line>NB:Assumptions of this calculation may cause over estimation of sample size when power is low.  However, true power associated with <in>cases</in> cases will be no less than <in>no_less</in> and no greater than <in>no_greater</in>.</block></line>
<line></line>
<line></line>
</report>
